 bonded toVDD in this LQFP100 package." (at 245 125 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 871b6f93-cd3a-4c49-88fd-1a3d6265621d)) (text "OUT1-4 TIM1 / OUT5-6 TIM8 / OUT7-8 TIM4.\nThree timer-rate groups; DMA/DShot needs bench validation.\nDedicated SPI1 IMU / SPI2 NAND / SPI3 external bus.\nGPIO alternate roles share physical pins.\nRaw ADC needs conditioning; no direct LiPo or servo power." (at 245 153 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 161c3d62-99d5-49e9-a8ad-acff17b9816b)))
